OL,3,AAztec document goes on display in
OL,4,AMexico after 186 years abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centuries-old document telling the
OL,7,Fstory of the Aztec civilisation and its
OL,8,Ffall after the arrival of the Spanish
OL,9,Fconquistadors in pictograms is going on
OL,10,Fdisplay in Mexico for the first time in
OL,11,F186 years.
OL,13,FThe manuscript, known as Codex
OL,14,FAzcatitlan, has been held in France's
OL,15,FBibliotheque Nationale since 1898, but
OL,16,Fhad already spent decades outside of
OL,17,FMexico before that.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
