OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAztec document goes on display in
OL,4,AMexico after 186 years abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is thought to have been drawn in the
OL,7,F16th Century - a few years after the
OL,8,Farrival of the conquistadors in what is
OL,9,Fnow Mexico - and is widely considered
OL,10,Fone of the most valuable and insightful
OL,11,Ftellings of the history of the Aztecs.
OL,13,FFrance has lent Codex Azcatitlan to
OL,14,FMexico to mark 200 years of
OL,15,FFranco-Mexican relations.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
